## 2. SetupOptions — параметры безопасности делегата

### cerber-passwordless-auth-disabled (V-1)

| | Android | iOS |
|---|---|---|
| **Критичность** | MEDIUM \| WARNING+MEDIUM | 🔴 ERROR (критично для авторизации) |
| **Semgrep** | ❌ | ✅ `passwordless-disabled.yml` |
| **TP** | Литерал `disablePasswordlessAuth: true` | `disablePasswordlessAuth: true` в SetupOptions |

**Android (дефект):**
```kotlin
class MainApp : Application(), CerberSDKApplication {
    
    private val cerberSDKApplicationDelegate = CerberSDKApplicationDelegate(
        authorizationMode = AuthorizationMode.CERBER,
        buildType = BuildType.PROM,
        isolated = false,
        secureInitialCheck = true,
        secureScreen = true,
        secureClipboard = true,
        enableTestServerPinning = false,
        sberMagOptions = null,
        whiteListOptions = emptyList(),
        disablePasswordlessAuth = true  // ← ДЕФЕКТ: вход по SMS отключён
    )
}
```

**iOS (SberApps):**
```swift
// Apps/FlowCooridnators/CerberFlowCoordinator.swift
cerber.options = SetupOptions(
    mode: AppConfiguration.cerberMode,
    loginOptions: AppConfiguration.loginOptions,
    isPasswordlessEnabled: true,  // ← ИСПРАВНО: passwordless включён
    jailbreakCheckerType: .lite,
    accessGroupID: nil,
    loggerOptions: [.logEnabled, .debug, .fileLogEnabled],
    enableTestSSLPinning: true
)
```

> **Вывод:** iOS-аналог реализован корректно: `isPasswordlessEnabled: true`. Семгреп-правило готово (`passwordless-disabled.yml`) для выявления дефектов при будущих изменениях.

