### cerber-clipboard-write-result-ignored (V-17)

| | Android | iOS |
|---|---|---|
| **Критичность** | MEDIUM \| WARNING+MEDIUM | ℹ️ MEDIUM |
| **Semgrep** | ❌ | ❌ Не создано |

**Android (дефект):**
```kotlin
class MainActivity : ComponentActivity() {
    fun copyToCerberClipboard(text: String) {
